@@ -844,6 +844,13 @@ The format of this change log follows the advice given at [Keep a CHANGELOG](htt
 
   For more information see [MDL-87887](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-87887)
 
+- The view and manage subscribers menu on the forum subscribers page is now rendered as a tertiary navigation selector.
+  The `mod_forum/forum_subscription_action` template receives the menu in a new `viewandmanagemenu` context key.
+  The `viewandmanageselect` context key is still provided with its previous `core/url_select` structure, so existing template overrides continue to work,
+  but they are deprecated and should be updated to use `viewandmanagemenu` with `core/tertiary_navigation_selector`.
+
+  For more information see [MDL-89890](https://tracker.moodle.org/browse/MDL-89890)
+
 ### mod_quiz
 
 #### Added
